<title>SPAIN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to Spain's ICO long-term pta debt.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to Spain's ICO long-term pta debt.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's rating agency said on Friday it had assigned a  rating of &quot;AAA&quot; to the long-term peseta debt of Spain's Official Credit Institute (ICO).  </p>
<p>&quot;This rating is based completely on the expectation of continued support from the state. This expectation is justified clearly by the explicit guarantee of the state to ICO debt, the legal status of the entity, and its importance as a provider of essential public service,&quot; S&amp;P said in a note.</p>
<p>The outlook for the group was stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
